 +\left\lVert (-L)^{1/2}K_t\right\rVert_{\mathcal H\to\mathcal H}
 \le C_t.$$ The corresponding finite-dimensional bounds are uniform in $n$ on the retained disorder events. Here $L$ is the generator of componentwise stationary heat flow, rather than the generator of $K$.

